  - m_Id: 858432430080
    m_Localized: Short description of the win/loss condition. Shown in lists and
      must be compact.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 858440818688
    m_Localized: 'Warnings are displayed when loss conditions are ~80% done. This
      should indicate a sense of urgency, basically "You are about to lose!"

      {0}
      is a number'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 858440818689
    m_Localized: 'GameOver text is displayed when the player loses the game because
      of this condition.

      {0} is a number.'
